# Used with: scripts/e2e.sh tests/e2e/preview.actions -- target/debug/temzdf standalone pdf target/fixtures/sample.pdf
# Coordinates assume the default 900x600 window (fit width, page 1 at the top).
# Judged (expect, the timing replayed): resting on "3 Filler" in the table of
# contents opens a preview of section 3 above it (no room below) with the
# page's columns aligned (preview); the wheel over the preview scrolls it, not
# the page (preview-scrolled); moving away closes it (closed).
pause 1
move 150 412
pause 1
expect preview
move 150 380
move 300 300
pause 0.1
wheel 3 300 300
pause 0.5
expect preview-scrolled
move 800 60
pause 1
expect closed
